error[SE0234]: a record field may not carry an extent
 --> tests/err/extent.se:7:7
  |
7 |     v [3]: double(m/s);
  |       ^^^ arrays are not permitted here
  = note: a port and a record field both live in the signal block, whose offsets come from `offsetof` — a run-time-sized member would destroy that (§15.5)
  = note: only a state and a var may be array-shaped (§6.4a)
  = help: cross a wire as N ports or as a fixed record instead

